        "summary":  "CSG Forte president Saurabh Joshi argues that embedding compliance frameworks like the EU AI Act and DORA into technology architecture from the start turns regulatory readiness into a competitive differentiator rather than a cost center. He identifies three advantages: controls-by-design that become customer-facing trust features, cross-functional alignment across product/risk/compliance, and strategic partnerships. CSG Forte\u0027s IBM-partnered PaymentsProtection.ai reportedly cut fraud losses 50-70%.",
