        "summary":  "BMC\u0027s annual survey of 1,300 mainframe professionals shows 94% expect continued long-term investment in the platform, with nearly half identifying AI tool adoption as a top priority. Organizations are integrating AI agents into mainframe operations rather than replacing the platform with cloud alternatives, partly due to data privacy concerns around cloud-based generative AI. The workforce profile is also shifting positively, with millennials now comprising more than half of mainframe professionals.",
